            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CodexMate 0.0.23

- Reduces idle energy use by pausing idle, unread, and failed notch sprite animations until the notch is hovered or the menu is open.
- Keeps the initial loading three-dot animation moving while recent threads are loading.
- Limits global pointer movement handling so off-notch mouse movement avoids unnecessary main-thread work.
]]></description>
